# Copy to tests/integration/.env to arm this machine for integration tests.
#
# The file's presence is the switch: every lifecycle script requires it, and
# scripts/integration_gate.sh runs the integration tests before each push
# while it exists (a machine without the file skips them). Nothing in here is
# required. Credentials come from the cveta2 Secrets on the cluster through
# the k8s-infra skill (`cvat.py / minio.py / clearml.py --project cveta2 env`),
# the run tag from `infra.py newtag --project cveta2`; neither lives in a file.
#
# Optional overrides (a value here wins over the shell for every run on this
# machine, so put per-run choices such as INFRA_HARNESS in the shell instead):
#
# The k8s-infra skill, when it is not installed under ~/.agents/skills or
# ~/.claude/skills:
#K8S_INFRA_SKILL_DIR=/path/to/k8s-infra/skills/k8s-infra
